Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:30.97,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Distant memory of a past life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.08,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}He's back in force and he's leading the way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:37.43,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Has something changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:43.13,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's an inner strength you find hard to define
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.09,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}But now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:46.43,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's here somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.64,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Maybe this is your …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:51.35,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to Move On
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.43,0:01:54.99,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Rise up with the Dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:59.00,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Stop could be your big win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:00.92,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's right there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.89,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}For you to grab your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.54,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to become
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:09.08,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:12.54,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to Move On
