Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:34.92,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}I'll show you how to live
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:38.81,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}在那笨拙的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:44.41,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}仰望你耀眼的微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:49.14,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}被染上樱色
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:52.04,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}I just say
